1
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:04,780
The Shadow is almost upon us, Aragorn.

2
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:10,880
Soon I must come unto all that I strove
for, or I will fall into darkness.

3
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:14,600
You shall not pass!

4
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:17,660
And this world will come to ruin.

5
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:21,580
Long have you carried with
you the remnants of the past.

6
00:00:24,120 --> 00:00:26,220
This is your test.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,500
Every path you have trod through wilderness,
through war, has led to this road.

8
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:40,880
We come to it at last.

9
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:44,820
The great battle of our time.

10
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:49,370
The blade that was broken.

11
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:51,860
You return to Minas Tirith.

12
00:00:52,640 --> 00:00:56,740
Put aside the Ranger.
Become who you were born to be.

13
00:01:00,520 --> 00:01:01,420
No!

14
00:01:02,020 --> 00:01:04,040
Let him go, you filth!

15
00:01:17,180 --> 00:01:18,680
We fight.

16
00:01:19,740 --> 00:01:24,560
I see in your eyes the same fear
that would take the heart of me.

17
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:29,190
A day may come when the
courage of men fails.

18
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:33,220
When we forsake our friends and
break all bonds of fellowship.

19
00:01:36,020 --> 00:01:40,570
But it is not this day!
Whatever happens, stay with me.

20
00:01:40,620 --> 00:01:42,100
This day we fight!

21
00:01:57,720 --> 00:02:02,900
All we have to decide here is what to
do with the time that is given to us.

22
00:02:07,340 --> 00:02:11,120
Hold back! Hold back to the mountain!
